units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic

lattice bcc 3.300
region whole block 0 20 0 20 0 64.545 units lattice
create_box 1 whole

region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target

region projectile block 0 20 0 20 44.545 64.545 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile

group target region target
group projectile region projectile

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian

fix equil all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
thermo 100
run 100000
unfix equil

velocity projectile add 0.0 0.0 -20.0

fix impact all nve
run 200000